      external: 'The page and stylesheet stay in your own folder, and screenshots at your three change points can sit beside them. Note the file names in step 5.',
      creator: 'Your creator reads the reason beside each change point. A width chosen because your longest fact stopped wrapping is a real reason; a device name is not.',
